      "message": "<p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=1254342\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://tu.ts-dm.net/imgs/2025/11/c2799ed1577c750b.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></p><br /><br /><p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=1195666\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=1197029\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></p><br /><br /><div class=\"spoiler\"><div class=\"spoiler_control\"><input class=\"spoiler_btn\" type=\"button\" value=\"特别提醒与专属奖励发放规则\" onclick=\"n=this.parentNode.parentNode.lastChild;n.style.display=(n.style.display=='none'?'block':'none');return false;\"/></div><div class=\"spoiler_content\" style=\" display: none;\"><div class=\"showhide\">参与CP表演赛<font color=\"red\">任一轮</font>即可获得惠惠勋章（30天）<img src=\"img01/medal///4月/萌战冬季冠军.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br />参与CP表演赛<font color=\"red\"><strong>全过程</strong></font>可获得至少<font color=\"#ff4775\">150ww 300tsb</font><br />参与CP表演赛<font color=\"red\"><strong>全过程并登记</strong></font>可额外获得<font color=\"#ff4775\">50ww 100tsb+10xc+1能量值+10萌战投票积分+天使动漫萌战专属发帖背景木之本樱</font><br /><font color=\"red\">&lt;全过程=所有投票帖均按要求投票+回帖晒票，所有结果帖均按要求回帖&gt;</font><br />签名挂上萌战总帖链接参赛可得<font color=\"#ff4775\">xc奖励</font><br /><br />文字宣传<div class=\"blockcode\"><div></div><div id=\"code_code_1dn\"><ol><li>[url=forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=1254342]2025天使动漫萌战 CP表演赛[/url]</li></ol></div><em>复制代码</em></div>图片宣传<div class=\"blockcode\"><div></div><div id=\"code_code_b1h\"><ol><li>[url=https://www.tsdm39.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=1254342][img=600,400]https://tu.ts-dm.net/imgs/2025/11/fb7df2d80d5c56b5.png[/img][/url]</li></ol></div><em>复制代码</em></div><font color=\"red\">***奖励最高可获得<strong>240ww 440tsb 40xc+天使动漫萌战专属发帖背景木之本樱+10萌战投票积分</strong>，详情请见<a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=1254352\" target=\"_blank\">参与纪录登记处</a></font><br /><br /><font color=\"red\"><strong>注：</strong></font><br />1.<font color=\"darkorchid\">达到2能量值</font>可兑换黑兔勋章 （90天）<img src=\"img01/medal///7月/萌战黑兔.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><font color=\"red\">&lt;兑换需消耗能量值&gt;</font><br />2.<font color=\"darkorchid\">达到4能量值</font>可兑换<a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/img01/postbg/moe2017.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">立华奏背景（365天）</a><font color=\"red\">&lt;兑换需消耗能量值&gt;</font><br />3.<font color=\"darkorchid\">达到6能量值且近一个月内完整参与萌战季节篇/完结篇</font>可兑换<a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/img01/postbg/tsmwysn.JPG\" target=\"_blank\">光环-亚丝娜背景（365天）</a>或<a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/img01/postbg/tsmyxy.JPG\" target=\"_blank\">羽翼-小樱背景（365天）</a><font color=\"red\">&lt;兑换需消耗能量值&gt;</font><br />4.<font color=\"darkorchid\">达到100萌战总积分</font>可获得萌战荣耀纪念勋章（永久）<img src=\"img01/medal///7月/萌战荣耀.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br />5.<font color=\"darkorchid\">每达到50萌战投票积分</font>可领取一只萌战专属宠物（永久）<font color=\"red\">&lt;兑换不消耗积分&gt;</font><br /><img src=\"Pokemon/pm/20151.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"Pokemon/pm/20161.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"Pokemon/pm/20171.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"Pokemon/pm/20181.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"Pokemon/pm/20191.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"Pokemon/pm/20201.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"https://img.tsdm39.com/Pokemon/pm/20211.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br />6.<font color=\"darkorchid\">萌战总积分233分以上</font>，且在本版块至少发表1个五萌系列的<font color=\"red\">优秀帖</font>可获得永久第二称号牌：宝多六花<br /><img src=\"img01/title/宝多六花.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /><br /><font color=\"red\">更多奖励兑换说明详见：</font><a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=852509&amp;fromuid=1202448\" target=\"_blank\">【积分／勋章／背景／宠物／牌子申请贴】2L积分统计</a></div></div></div><br /><br /><hr class=\"l\" /><br /><p align=\"center\"><font size=\"5\"><font style=\"background-color:Purple\"><font color=\"White\"><strong>晋级本次CP表演赛复赛的组合</strong></font></font></font></p><br /><br /><br /><table><tr style=\"background-color:#5599FF\"><td